From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 11:53:59 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mshtml: document, persistence, view and OLE leftovers
 (display services, view object, hlink target, moniker save)

IHTMLDocument2: XML documents get a selection (the window's), a default bgColor, a loosened domain, and
InvalidStateError-style failure for write/writeln/open/close (clear does nothing), as the HTML standard has it;
expando, charset and defaultCharset keep what a script sets (an unknown charset is E_INVALIDARG);
queryCommandText gives the command's name; execCommandShowHelp runs the command with the SHOWHELP option;
createStyleSheet adds a link (with href) or an empty style element at the requested position, in the
document element of an XML document; IHTMLDocument3 baseUrl is settable; IHTMLDocument4 createDocumentFromUrl
loads a new document and createEventObject copies the event object given; createAttributeNS; the document
node can be cloned. IDisplayServices: TransformPoint/TransformRect between the coordinate systems,
ScrollRectIntoView, HasFlowLayout.

persist.c: IPersistMoniker::Save (to a file moniker or file: URL) and SaveCompleted, IMonikerProp on
USE_SRC_URL/TRUSTEDDOWNLOADPROP/POPUPLEVELPROP, IPersistStreamInit::GetSizeMax, IPersistHistory position
cookies (the scroll position), IHlinkTarget Set/GetBrowseContext, GetMoniker, GetFriendlyName and Navigate to a
bookmark. view.c: IOleDocumentView Open, SaveViewState/ApplyViewState, Clone and SetRectComplex;
IViewObjectEx Draw (the view window printed into the bounds), GetColorSet, Freeze/Unfreeze, GetAdvise,
GetExtent, GetRect, GetViewStatus, QueryHitPoint/Rect, GetNaturalExtent. oleobj.c: IOleObject Close saves a
dirty document through the container (IOleClientSite::SaveObject, after asking for PROMPTSAVE), SetMoniker,
InitFromData (HTML Format or text), SetColorScheme; IOleDocument::EnumViews with an enumerator; IOleControl
GetControlInfo/OnMnemonic/FreezeEvents; IOleContainer::ParseDisplayName; ITargetContainer::GetFrameUrl;
IObjectSafety options kept per interface. IHTMLWindow2::showHelp opens the help address with the shell.
IHTMLLinkElement::styleSheet finds the sheet the link owns.

